0..61 Comment "//! This source shows a judgement that waits on an owed code."
62..65 Comment "//!"
66..147 Comment "//! A value at the decode of an owed code waits for a fill. A fill with `Integer`"
148..208 Comment "//! settles the comparison. A fill with `String` refutes it."
